@host = http://localhost:8080

### 1) 회원가입 -> 201
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "test@example.com", "password": "Test1234!", "name": "tester" }

### 2) 회원가입 중복 -> 409 EMAIL_DUPLICATED (1번을 한 번 더)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "TEST@example.com", "password": "Test1234!", "name": "tester" }

### 3) 회원가입 검증 실패 -> 400 INVALID_REQUEST (비밀번호 규칙)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "bad", "password": "abc", "name": "" }

### 4) 로그인 -> 200, 토큰을 {{token}} 에 저장
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "test@example.com", "password": "Test1234!" }

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.data.accessToken); %}

### 5) 로그인 실패 -> 401 LOGIN_FAILED
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "test@example.com", "password": "wrong" }

### 6) 내 정보 -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7) 토큰 없음 -> 401 UNAUTHORIZED
GET {{host}}/api/v1/users/me

### 8) 잘못된 토큰 -> 401 UNAUTHORIZED
GET {{host}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer invalid.token.value
